{"2387670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "As One We Survive", "steam_appid": 2387670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4813220], "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/9fcdb094e82cb1ac91ce67a0d3c2c094.avif?t=1787572955\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/ff655090d5511fdb8b5667f0fd912260.avif?t=1787572955\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As One We Survive</strong> is a <strong>top-down survival game</strong> set in a <strong>post-apocalyptic</strong> America. Step into the shoes of a lone survivor and unite with fellow survivors to <strong>form a community</strong> during a grid-down post-pandemic event. <strong>Fight</strong>, <strong>scavenge</strong>, <strong>craft</strong>, and <strong>gather resources</strong> for your group's survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a <strong>unique blend of survival and community management mechanics</strong>, you will have to <strong>build and upgrade a safe haven</strong>, protect your people from danger, and make tough decisions that will determine the fate of your group in a harsh and unforgiving world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.poster.avif?t=1787572955\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.webm?t=1787572955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.mp4?t=1787572955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Survival:</strong> Scavenge, craft, and outsmart the harsh wilderness in a dangerous world with scarce resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving Combat:</strong> No health packs; use bandages to stop bleeding, sleep to heal injuries, and maintain weapons for reliability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Homestead Building:</strong> Claim a homestead, build facilities, and create renewable resources to support long-term survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Management:</strong> Recruit survivors, assign roles, and manage your people as your homestead grows.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC Companions</strong>: Form bonds with fellow survivors while scavenging for vital supplies and getting to know your community.  <strong>(Planned for the Early Access Roadmap)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Progression:</strong> Hone survival skills in the wilderness, improve with every challenge, and master the art of survival.  <strong>(Planned for the Early Access Roadmap)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Modes Of Play:</strong> Survival and Story.  Test your skills in the post-apocalyptic world through Survival mode, with Story Mode planned as a narrative experience for the full 1.0 release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A separate <strong>Story Mode</strong> is planned for the full <strong>1.0 release</strong>, following a <strong>father's desperate journey to find help for his sick daughter</strong> in a world that has fallen apart.    </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.poster.avif?t=1787572955\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.webm?t=1787572955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.mp4?t=1787572955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/8600ab9d0b28be5752ea4fde52a9f86b.avif?t=1787572955\" width=600 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Supply Runs:</strong> Gather food, water, and medicine for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Building and Resources:</strong> Construct facilities, create renewable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Form a Community:</strong> Recruit survivors to create a safe haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Answer the Call:</strong> Intercept radio signals to uncover survivors, threats, and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/09a4136a2ef9d7372966d821b5be26c5.poster.avif?t=1787572955\" width=600 height=252 ><sour